  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | Avondale, AZ\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Avondale, AZ\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nAvondale, AZ\nSpecialty and 24/7 Emergency\n623.385.4555\n13034 W Rancho Santa Fe Blvd. Ste. 101\nAvondale, AZ 85392\n[email protected]\ninstagram.com/bluepearlavondale\nEmergency:\n24/7\nSpecialty:\nCall for appointment\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nBluePearl Pet Hospital – serving the southwest Phoenix metro area.\nOur full-service pet hospital is located in Avondale, southwest of downtown Phoenix. We serve pets and their owners in the Avondale, Litchfield Park, Tolleson, Buckeye and surrounding communities.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen your pet needs emergency care, seconds count. Our team is ready to provide expert care 24/7 in case of a pet emergency. If your pet requires a veterinary specialist, we are ready for that too. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nIn an emergency, call ahead to your BluePearl vet and let us know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary for our emergency vet.\nLearn more about your emergency visit\n.\nSpecialty care\nOur veterinary specialists work directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialists are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Avondale.\nOur 7,000 square-foot pet hospital opened in 2009. Inside, you’ll find advanced technology and equipment, including an oxygen kennel, two ultrasound machines, surgical suites and a complete in-house laboratory.\nPet owners\nAt BluePearl, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n623.385.4555\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n623.385.4555\n623.385.4556\n13034 W Rancho Santa Fe Blvd.                                    Ste. 101\nAvondale,\nAZ                                    85392\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nPeoria, AZ\n20165 N 67th Ave., Ste. 118\nGlendale, AZ 85308\n623.974.1520\n16.05 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nScottsdale, AZ\n22595 N Scottsdale Rd., Ste. 110\nScottsdale, AZ 85255\n480.949.8001\n28.52 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nIrvine, CA\n1371 Reynolds Ave.\nIrvine, CA 92614\n949.833.9020\n318.03 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
